              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋun ŋakwapin ŋuna apotu Eleasar esacaradoti ka Yosua lokoku a Nun ta ŋikarikok a Ŋisirael tokorakis Ŋisirael. Apotu ikes tokora akwap anakilamilam alokiŋaren Ekapolon aneni enyaritae Silo, alo Eema a ŋolo elipere neni ke Ekapolon. Epite ŋol iŋes aponiata Ŋisirael tokoryata akwap kec.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.51"
            ]
          }
